@mcollina 
During the development of the feature, I noticed a strange behaviour, but I don't know if this is intentional or a bug.
Currently if you add the content type `application/jso`, it will be executed even though the content type `application/json` is set in the request. This is due to the use of the method `indexOf` in the [contentTypeParser](https://github.com/fastify/fastify/blob/4a22bb0b4e296ee78e2e4a466d94f360e3a3025b/lib/contentTypeParser.js#L86), which obviously finds the string `application/jso` in the string `application/json`.
